---
description: How this Opptra app is branched, reviewed, and deployed
alwaysApply: true
---

Deploy only through the GitHub workflows that call opptra/sdlc. Terraform is what creates, changes, and deletes GCP resources.

A feature branch comes off staging. A pull request into staging plans the shared staging project and does not change it. The merge builds the image and applies that plan. A pull request from staging into main plans prod_project from service.yaml, and the merge applies it.

Do not add a deploy script that targets production. Do not run gcloud run deploy. Do not commit secrets or bake them into an image. The image tag is the git SHA.

Keep a pull request to one change. Split product code away from edits to .github/workflows, infra/, or service.yaml.

New UI code is Vite, React, and TypeScript. New API code is FastAPI. Auth is the auth field in service.yaml.

Rollback is a revert merged to staging and then to main.
